---
description: pnpm minimumReleaseAge exclusions — do not bypass for follow-redirects
alwaysApply: true
---

### `minimumReleaseAgeExclude`

Never add `follow-redirects` to `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`. Prefer `pnpm.overrides` (or waiting for the release-age window) to adopt patched versions without carving out an exception for that package.
